text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C25B3 {
    "The sea is teeming with POKéMON.\nIt’s not easy swimming, I tell you."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C25F8 {
    "POKéMON raised by TRAINERS are\nseriously tough..."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C262A {
    "Gasp... Gasp... I’m wiped out...\pThe going’s easy. It’s the leaving\nthat’s the hard part.\pWill I have any energy left to make\nthe return trip?"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C26B9 {
    "The sea... The sea... The sea...\nThe sea as far as these eyes can see!\lI’m sick and tired of the sea!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C271F {
    "Bleah!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2726 {
    "Bored I am by the sea, but swim I must.\pI’m a born swimmer!\nThat’s what I am."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2774 {
    "Hi, sweetie, wait!\nWe should battle, you and I!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C27A4 {
    "You’re tough in spite of the way\nyou look!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C27CF {
    "Did you see a guy over there who whines\nthat he’s bored of the sea?\pThat’s all talk.\nHe’s hopelessly in love with the sea!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C284A {
    "Why do men love bathing suits so much?\pThey all ogle me!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2883 {
    "I’m out of my depth!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2898 {
    "Maybe it’s not my bathing suit that\nmakes men look. It must be my beauty!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C28E2 {
    "RELI: We’ll work together as siblings\nto take you on!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2918 {
    "RELI: We couldn’t win even though we\nworked together..."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2950 {
    "RELI: The people of PACIFIDLOG are\ntogether with the sea and POKéMON from\lthe time they are born."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C29B2 {
    "RELI: You don’t have two POKéMON?\nWe can’t enjoy a battle, then."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C29F3 {
    "IAN: I’m doing my best together with\nmy sis!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2A20 {
    "IAN: I did my best with my sis, but\nwe still couldn’t win..."
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2A5D {
    "IAN: You know how PACIFIDLOG is\na floating town?\pSo, wherever there is the sea, that’s\na part of PACIFIDLOG!"
}

text Naranja_Route131_G00_M46_Text_081C2ACA {
    "IAN: If you have two POKéMON, we’ll\ntake you on!"
}
